  "description": "Expose ASP.NET Core OData (Microsoft.AspNetCore.OData 8/9) endpoints as Model Context\n      Protocol (MCP) tools with the same [McpTool] attribute the core package uses for controllers.\n      Tool calls are replayed through the application's own HTTP pipeline - authentication,\n      authorization, [EnableQuery] and the OData formatters all keep working - and queryable\n      actions additionally advertise $filter, $select, $orderby, $top, $skip, $count and friends\n      as tool inputs.",
